{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログはなんだか途中\n力尽きてた(´・ω・｀)ごめなさいーなにゆえー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のクイズの答えは 102曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"履歴全部写めったー感動したー\nここには貼らんけどー書かんけどー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね楽しかったですよ( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行こうねー♪\n姉さんと３人で行きたいでーすー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"履歴は貼らんけど。そうですねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵比中さんの「仮契約のシンデレラ」なんか\nひとりで歌ったからねー///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベスト・オブ・楽しかった曲(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいーそんな感じでねっえー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでると\n「ひめたんの新衣装みたい！」ってお声\nいっぱいありがとー\\(  ω  )/歓喜ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでひめたんは\n写め撮ってないのほんとに。けへー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねーけへーとか言ってる場合ちゃうねん\nなんで写め撮ってないの\n自分なんでよねえー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新衣装すきー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたさん＆じょーさん＆ずーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのお勧め散歩ソングは、何ですか？\nなんでしょうー\n乃木坂の曲をシャッフルでもして聴くと\n全部で25曲あるからね飽きないね。\n個人的に「涙がまだ悲しみだった頃」の\nオケ好きよ(〃ω〃)歌入りももちろんだけどー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島弁の「わや」って\nどんなときに使いますか？\n\"カオスッッッ\"\nって感じの時ですかね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーがドラマで\n広島弁を使ってたようだけど、\nひめたんに教えてもらいに来た？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにヒロシマの方言指導とか\nしなかったの？\nいやいやー\n先生から習ったゆーてましたよー＊\nみんな頑張ってましたね\\(  ω  )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは普段メンバーと話すとき\n広島弁出たりするのー？あと家族といるときは\nバリバリの広島弁？(*^^*)\nえっとね、標準語も混ざりつつ\n最近は関西弁にもハマりつつ、ごっちゃやね。\nまさに\"わやー\"。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは大和ミュージアム\nいったことありますか？\nあるよー！\nおっきい船の模型があったの覚えてるよー\n戦艦カレーみたいなのがあった気がするよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビームのコツ教えて〜?\n瞳をギラギラさせてみましょう(<・ω・>)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっといろいろあってびしょびしょ@新曲MV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/11/5866181/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風くるぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}